efendant opposite party nos. 47 & 48 were Requisitioned under Section 3 of the East Bengal ( Emergency) Requisition of property Act. 1948 (E.B Act XIII of 1948) by notification; thereafter the said land was Requisitioned by Government letter being No. 2620 of dated 15.08.1956 in favour of the said predecessor in interest Moulvi Abul Fazal and his brothers of the defendant Opposite party Nos. 47 & 48; the predecessors of the Defendants- opposite parties were taken award money as Awardee; later on, the concerning office of the Government has issued a latter and directed to deposit development cost of Rs. 8,620 to the Government which were taken earlier; the said Abul Fazal Mohammad in compliance with the direction of the Government deposited the said amount to the 

